Descriptor ExitWithdrawType
    documentation 'This descriptor defines the circumstances under which the student exited from 
                  'membership in an educational institution.
    with optional map type
        item Transferred
        item Graduated
        item Completed
        item Died or is permanently incapacitated
        item Withdrawn
        item Expelled
        item Reached maximum age
        item Enrolled in a high school diploma program
        item Involuntarily Removed
        item Incarcerated
        item Dropout
        item End of school year
        item Invalid enrollment
        item No show
        item Other